  "titulo": "Using ordinal numbers with events, celebrations and anniversaries",
  "subtitulo": "El vigésimo aniversario, la décima edición: ordinals beyond tenth.",
  "foto": "t08.jpg",
  "regla": "Ordinals for events in a series: décimo, undécimo / decimoprimero, vigésimo, trigésimo… They agree in gender: la vigésima edición. In speech, cardinals are common after 10.",
